// Template for local-only build settings that must never be committed.
//
// Usage:
//   cp Config/Secrets.xcconfig.example Config/Secrets.xcconfig
//
// Config/Secrets.xcconfig is gitignored. Nothing here is required to build —
// Config/Common.xcconfig includes it optionally, so a clean checkout works
// without the file.
//
// Do NOT put long-lived credentials here for release builds. Signing material
// and API keys reach CI through GitHub Secrets / App Store Connect API keys,
// never through a file in the repository. This file exists for local development
// conveniences only (a developer's own throwaway API key against a local
// simulator, for instance).
//
// See Zen-Agent-Blueprint → Design/Zen Agent 工程与发布.md §8
// and Zen-Agent-Blueprint → Design/Zen Agent 安全与权限.md §2.

// Example — replace with your own local-only value, or delete the line:
// ZEN_DEV_PROVIDER_API_KEY = sk-replace-me

// Simulator-only: never commit a real key. If you find yourself wanting to run a
// real Provider smoke test, use the CI path with a protected secret instead.
